From fe34f38d0c998cf34ace02d09bf97774f38e65df Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Diego Amicabile <diego.amicabile@soprasteria.com>
Date: Fri, 6 Nov 2026 21:28:20 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] Borg: value the staff-holiness dispel as an area of sight

The activation floods the area with goodness, hitting every evil
monster in sight, but the maneuver kept the bolt radius of zero and
valued a single target on a line.  Use the LOS-dispel radius of ten,
which the corrected launch now values as the sight-line sum.  Stacked
on the LOS-dispel walk correction.

diff --git a/src/borg/borg-fight-attack.c b/src/borg/borg-fight-attack.c
index 25531ddb9..0c68a2c68 100644
--- a/src/borg/borg-fight-attack.c
+++ b/src/borg/borg-fight-attack.c
@@ -4717,6 +4717,9 @@ int borg_calculate_attack_effectiveness(int attack_type)
             act_wonder, rad, dam, BORG_ATTACK_MISSILE, true, -1));
 
     case BF_ACT_STAFF_HOLY:
+        /* The effect floods the area with goodness: an area-of-sight
+         * dispel, not a single-target bolt. */
+        rad = 10;
         if (borg.trait[BI_CURHP] < borg.trait[BI_MAXHP] / 2)
             dam = 500;
         else
